tree-sitter-vb6: vendored from https://github.com/joannefan/tree-sitter-vb6
at commit 1ee443353ce49f12e39a8e627b557c59e348b729.
The vendored src/grammar.json, src/parser.c and src/node-types.json are
byte-identical to that commit's.

